<I>Solution II:</I> <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 20 mM Potassium phosphate buffer (pH 7.8)             </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;500.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
Separately autoclave Solutions I and II.   Mix aseptically and      adjust final pH to 7.7-7.8.       <br>
